        <headline>Severe heatwave warning for Queensland</headline>
        <description>
          Areas over inland parts will see maximum temperatures in the high thirties to low forties and overnight minimum temperatures in the mid twenties. 

Areas closer to the coast will see maximum temperatures in the low to high thirties with overnight minimum temperatures in the low to mid twenties. 

Severe heatwave conditions are expected to intensify and persist into the weekend. Locations likely to be impacted include Aurukun, Kowanyama, Pormpuraaw and Weipa.
        </description>
